        "type": "sentence",
        "content": "What do you know about life on Earth thousands of years ago?"
      },
      {
        "type": "sentence",
        "content": "Fossils give us some clues. Fossils are shapes in rocks that show"
      },
      {
        "type": "sentence",
        "content": "the animals and plants that lived at this time. To be a fossil, the"
      },
