        "content": "shape has to be at least ten thousand years old. Sometimes"
      },
      {
        "type": "sentence",
        "content": "fossils show the shape of the animal, or its skeleton. Other fossils"
      },
      {
        "type": "sentence",
        "content": "show an animal's footprints, eggs, or nest. Fossils can be of"
      },
      {
        "type": "sentence",
        "content": "dinosaurs, whales, or fish. Some fossils are 500 million years old."
      },
      {
        "type": "sentence",
        "content": "Fossils tell us about the past. We can learn about types of rocks,"
